                    },
                    "description": "API to cancel a running broadcast execution. You can cancel a broadcast by passing any combination of filters in the request body. When multiple parameters are provided, they are **ANDed** together to narrow down the matching broadcast runs.\n\nFor example, passing both `list_id` and `idempotency_key` will cancel only the broadcast runs that match both the given list and idempotency key.\n"
